<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#06120c">

<title>NeonAV Secure PRO ULTRA</title>

<style>
:root{
    --bg:#030806;
    --panel:#07130d;
    --panel2:#0b1c13;
    --border:#123b27;
    --green:#00ff88;
    --green2:#00c96b;
    --text:#eafff2;
    --muted:#86a997;
    --red:#ff405f;
    --orange:#ffad32;
    --yellow:#ffe66d;
    --blue:#43b5ff;
    --shadow:0 0 25px rgba(0,255,136,.08);
}

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%,rgba(0,255,136,.08),transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%,rgba(0,180,100,.06),transparent 25%),
        var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    min-height:100vh;
}

button,
input,
select{
    font:inherit;
}

button{
    cursor:pointer;
}

.app{
    max-width:1500px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:20px;
}

/* Estilos da Capa */
.cover{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background-color:#030806;
    background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%,rgba(0,255,136,.08),transparent 25%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%,rgba(0,180,100,.06),transparent 25%);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    z-index:100;
    transition:opacity .5s ease-out, visibility .5s ease-out;
}

.cover.hidden{
    opacity:0;
    visibility:hidden;
}

.cover-content{
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
    max-width:850px;
}

.cover-logo{
    font-size:120px;
    color:var(--green);
    filter:drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(0,255,136,.5));
    animation:pulse 2s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse{
    0%{ transform:scale(1); filter:drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(0,255,136,.5)); }
    50%{ transform:scale(1.05); filter:drop-shadow(0 0 70px rgba(0,255,136,.7)); }
    100%{ transform:scale(1); filter:drop-shadow(0 0 50px rgba(0,255,136,.5)); }
}

.cover-title{
    font-size:50px;
    margin:15px 0 10px;
    color:var(--green);
    text-shadow:0 0 25px var(--green);
}

.cover-subtitle{
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:30px;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}

.cover-features{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:12px;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-top:20px;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}

.cover-feature{
    padding:8px 18px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:30px;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted);
    background:rgba(7,19,13,.5);
}

/* Botões interativos na Capa */
.cover-actions{
    display:flex;
    gap:15px;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.cover-btn{
    padding:14px 28px;
    border-radius:12px;
    font-size:15px;
    font-weight:bold;
    transition:.2s;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
}

.cover-btn.primary{
    background:var(--green);
    color:#00170c;
    border-color:var(--green);
    box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(0,255,136,.3);
}

.cover-btn.primary:hover{
    box-shadow:0 0 35px rgba(0,255,136,.5);
    transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.cover-btn.secondary{
    background:#0a1d13;
    color:var(--text);
    border-color:var(--border);
}

.cover-btn.secondary:hover{
    border-color:var(--green);
    box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,136,.15);
    transform:translateY(-2px);
}

/* Resto dos estilos originais */
header{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:20px;
    padding:20px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:18px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#06120b,#0b1c13);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:15px;
}

.logo{
    width:58px;
    height:58px;
    border-radius:16px;
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    font-size:28px;
    color:#00150b;
    background:var(--green);
    box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(0,255,136,.35);
}

h1{
    margin:0;
    font-size:25px;
}

.subtitle{
    margin:5px 0 0;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:13px;
}

.status{
    padding:10px 15px;
    border:1px solid rgba(0,255,136,.3);
    border-radius:30px;
    color:var(--green);
    background:rgba(0,255,136,.06);
    font-weight:bold;
    font-size:13px;
}

.dashboard{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
    gap:12px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:18px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.metric-title{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:12px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
}

.metric-value{
    font-size:27px;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-top:8px;
}

.green{
    color:var(--green);
}

.orange{
    color:var(--orange);
}

.red{
    color:var(--red);
}

.blue{
    color:var(--blue);
}

.yellow{
    color:var(--yellow);
}

.main{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.4fr .6fr;
    gap:20px;
}

.panel{
    background:rgba(7,19,13,.94);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:20px;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.panel h2{
    margin-top:0;
    font-size:18px;
}

.dropzone{
    min-height:210px;
    border:2px dashed #195b3b;
    border-radius:16px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
    transition:.2s;
    background:rgba(0,255,136,.025);
}

.dropzone.drag{
    border-color:var(--green);
    background:rgba(0,255,136,.08);
    transform:scale(1.01);
}

.drop-icon{
    font-size:50px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.dropzone strong{
    color:var(--green);
}

.actions{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:9px;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.btn{
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    background:#0a1d13;
    color:var(--text);
    padding:10px 14px;
    border-radius:10px;
    transition:.2s;
}

.btn:hover{
    border-color:var(--green);
    box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,136,.12);
}

.btn.primary{
    background:var(--green);
    color:#00170c;
    border-color:var(--green);
    font-weight:bold;
}

.btn.danger{
    color:#fff;
    background:#3a1019;
    border-color:#6c1b2d;
}

.btn.warning{
    color:#111;
    background:var(--orange);
    border-color:var(--orange);
}

.btn.blue{
    color:#06131d;
    background:var(--blue);
}

input,
select{
    width:100%;
    padding:11px;
    color:var(--text);
    background:#04100a;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:9px;
    outline:none;
}

input:focus,
select:focus{
    border-color:var(--green);
    box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,255,136,.1);
}

.form-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:10px;
}

.progress{
    height:12px;
    background:#020805;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top:15px;
}

.progress-bar{
    height:100%;
    width:0%;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green2),var(--green));
    box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,136,.35);
    transition:.2s;
}

.progress-text{
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-top:7px;
}

.filters{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap:10px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.results{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
}

.result{
    background:#06110b;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-left:4px solid var(--green);
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px;
}

.result.medium{
    border-left-color:var(--yellow);
}

.result.high{
    border-left-color:var(--orange);
}

.result.critical{
    border-left-color:var(--red);
}

.result-head{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    gap:12px;
}

.filename{
    font-size:17px;
    font-weight:bold;
    word-break:break-word;
}

.meta{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:12px;
    margin-top:6px;
}

.badge{
    padding:6px 10px;
    border-radius:20px;
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:bold;
    white-space:nowrap;
}

.badge.low{
    color:#00170c;
    background:var(--green);
}

.badge.medium{
    color:#191300;
    background:var(--yellow);
}

.badge.high{
    color:#211000;
    background:var(--orange);
}

.badge.critical{
    color:#fff;
    background:var(--red);
}

.score{
    font-size:25px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

.result-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:14px;
}

.info{
    padding:10px;
    background:#08170f;
    border-radius:9px;
    border:1px solid #0e2c1c;
}

.info small{
    display:block;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.hash{
    word-break:break-all;
    font-family:monospace;
    font-size:11px;
}

.reasons{
    margin-top:14px;
}

.reasons ul{
    margin-bottom:0;
    padding-left:20px;
}

.reasons li{
    margin:5px 0;
    color:#c8e9d5;
}

.ioc{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:5px 8px;
    margin:3px;
    border-radius:6px;
    font-family:monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    background:#241019;
    border:1px solid #60213a;
    color:#ff9bb0;
}

.log{
    max-height:300px;
    overflow:auto;
    background:#020704;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px;
    font-family:monospace;
    font-size:11px;
}

.log-line{
    padding:4px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid #082014;
}

.log-time{
    color:var(--green);
}

.empty{
    text-align:center;
    color:var(--muted);
    padding:35px 10px;
}

.stats-bar{
    margin-top:10px;
}

.stats-label{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:4px;
}

.stats-track{
    height:8px;
    background:#020805;
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.stats-fill{
    height:100%;
    background:var(--green);
}

.footer{
    text-align:center;
    color:#527060;
    font-size:11px;
    margin-top:25px;
    padding:15px;
}

.modal{
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.75);
    display:none;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:20px;
    z-index:50;
}

.modal.show{
    display:flex;
}

.modal-box{
    width:min(800px,100%);
    max-height:90vh;
    overflow:auto;
    background:#07130d;
    border:1px solid var(--green);
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:20px;
    box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(0,255,136,.15);
}

.close{
    float:right;
    border:0;
    background:transparent;
    color:#fff;
    font-size:25px;
}

.test-file{
    padding:12px;
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:10px;
    margin:8px 0;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
}

.toggle{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:10px;
    padding:10px;
    border-bottom:1px solid #0b2819;
}

.toggle input{
    width:auto;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){
    .dashboard{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    }

    .main{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
}

@media(max-width:700px){
    .app{
        padding:10px;
    }

    header{
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
    }

    .dashboard{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .filters,
    .form-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .result-grid{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .result-head{
        flex-direction:column;
    }

    .cover-title{ font-size:35px; }
    .cover-logo{ font-size:90px; }
}

@media(max-width:420px){
    .dashboard{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .result-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Capa com Botões Clicáveis -->
<div class="cover" id="coverScreen">
    <div class="cover-content">
        <div class="cover-logo">🛡️</div>
        <h2 class="cover-title">NeonAV Secure PRO ULTRA</h2>
        <div class="cover-subtitle">Scanner Heurístico Local Avançado</div>
        
        <div class="cover-features">
            <span class="cover-feature">Proteção Offline</span>
            <span class="cover-feature">SHA-512</span>
            <span class="cover-feature">Análise IOC</span>
            <span class="cover-feature">Entropia de Bytes</span>
        </div>

        <div class="cover-actions">
            <button class="cover-btn primary" id="coverStartBtn">🚀 Acessar Sistema</button>
            <button class="cover-btn secondary" id="coverTestBtn">🧪 Abrir Laboratório de Testes</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="app">

<header>

<div class="brand">
<div class="logo">🛡️</div>

<div>
<h1>NeonAV Secure PRO ULTRA</h1>
<div class="subtitle">
Scanner heurístico local • SHA-512 • IOC • Entropia • Relatórios
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="status" id="status">
● SISTEMA PRONTO
</div>

</header>


<section class="dashboard">

<div class="card">
<div class="metric-title">Arquivos</div>
<div class="metric-value green" id="totalFiles">0</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="metric-title">Baixo</div>
<div class="metric-value green" id="lowCount">0</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="metric-title">Médio</div>
<div class="metric-value yellow" id="mediumCount">0</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="metric-title">Alto</div>
<div class="metric-value orange" id="highCount">0</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="metric-title">Crítico</div>
<div class="metric-value red" id="criticalCount">0</div>
</div>

</section>


<div class="main">

<main>

<section class="panel">

<h2>🔍 Área de análise</h2>

<div class="dropzone" id="dropzone">

<div>

<div class="drop-icon">📁</div>

<strong>Arraste arquivos aqui</strong>

<div style="margin:8px;color:var(--muted)">
ou utilize o botão abaixo
</div>

<input
type="file"
id="fileInput"
multiple
style="display:none"
>

<button
class="btn primary"
id="selectBtn"
>
Selecionar arquivos
</button>

</div>

</div>


<div class="actions">

<button class="btn primary" id="scanBtn">
🛡️ Iniciar análise
</button>

<button class="btn blue" id="testBtn">
🧪 Arquivos de teste
</button>

<button class="btn" id="jsonBtn">
JSON
</button>

<button class="btn" id="csvBtn">
CSV
</button>

<button class="btn" id="htmlBtn">
Relatório HTML
</button>

<button class="btn danger" id="clearBtn">
Limpar
</button>

</div>


<div class="progress">

<div
class="progress-bar"
id="progressBar"
></div>

</div>

<div
class="progress-text"
id="progressText"
>
Aguardando arquivos...
</div>

</section>


<section class="panel">

<h2>📋 Resultados</h2>

<div class="filters">

<input
id="searchInput"
placeholder="🔎 Pesquisar arquivo, hash ou IOC..."
>

<select id="riskFilter">

<option value="all">
Todos os riscos
</option>

<option value="low">
Baixo
</option>

<option value="medium">
Médio
</option>

<option value="high">
Alto
</option>

<option value="critical">
Crítico
</option>

</select>

<select id="sortSelect">

<option value="new">
Mais recentes
</option>

<option value="score">
Maior risco
</option>

<option value="name">
Nome
</option>

<option value="size">
Tamanho
</option>

</select>

</div>

<div id="results" class="results">

<div class="empty">
Nenhum arquivo analisado.
</div>

</div>

</section>

</main>


<aside>

<section class="panel">

<h2>📊 Estatísticas</h2>

<div class="metric-title">
Média de risco
</div>

<div
class="metric-value green"
id="averageScore"
>
0
</div>

<div class="stats-bar">

<div class="stats-label">
<span>Baixo</span>
<span id="lowPercent">0%</span>
</div>

<div class="stats-track">
<div
class="stats-fill"
id="lowFill"
style="width:0%"
></div>
</div>

</div>


<div class="stats-bar">

<div class="stats-label">
<span>Médio</span>
<span id="mediumPercent">0%</span>
</div>

<div class="stats-track">
<div
class="stats-fill"
id="mediumFill"
style="width:0%"
></div>
</div>

</div>


<div class="stats-bar">

<div class="stats-label">
<span>Alto</span>
<span id="highPercent">0%</span>
</div>

<div class="stats-track">
<div
class="stats-fill"
id="highFill"
style="width:0%"
></div>
</div>

</div>


<div class="stats-bar">

<div class="stats-label">
<span>Crítico</span>
<span id="criticalPercent">0%</span>
</div>

<div class="stats-track">
<div
class="stats-fill"
id="criticalFill"
style="width:0%"
></div>
</div>

</div>

</section>


<section class="panel">

<h2>⚙️ Configurações</h2>

<div class="toggle">
<span>Detectar URLs</span>
<input
type="checkbox"
id="cfgUrls"
checked
>
</div>

<div class="toggle">
<span>Analisar entropia</span>
<input
type="checkbox"
id="cfgEntropy"
checked
>
</div>

<div class="toggle">
<span>Detectar extensões suspeitas</span>
<input
type="checkbox"
id="cfgExtension"
checked
>
</div>

<div class="toggle">
<span>Detectar IOCs</span>
<input
type="checkbox"
id="cfgIoc"
checked
>
</div>

<div style="margin-top:15px">

<label class="metric-title">
Limite por arquivo
</label>

<select id="sizeLimit">

<option value="5">5 MB</option>
<option value="10" selected>10 MB</option>
<option value="25">25 MB</option>
<option value="50">50 MB</option>

</select>

</div>

</section>


<section class="panel">

<h2>📝 Log</h2>

<div
class="log"
id="log"
>
<div class="log-line">
<span class="log-time">[READY]</span>
NeonAV inicializado.
</div>
</div>

</section>

</aside>

</div>


<div class="footer">
NeonAV Secure PRO ULTRA • análise local no navegador • uso educacional e defensivo
</div>

</div>


<div class="modal" id="testModal">

<div class="modal-box">

<button
class="close"
id="closeModal"
>
×
</button>

<h2>🧪 Laboratório de testes</h2>

<p style="color:var(--muted)">
Estes arquivos são gerados localmente e não contêm malware real.
Eles servem apenas para testar as heurísticas do NeonAV.
</p>

<div class="test-file">

<div>
<strong>Arquivo limpo</strong>
<div class="meta">
Texto sem indicadores
</div>
</div>

<button
class="btn primary"
data-test="clean"
>
Adicionar
</button>

</div>


<div class="test-file">

<div>
<strong>Teste JavaScript</strong>
<div class="meta">
Simula indicadores de keylogger/obfuscação
</div>
</div>

<button
class="btn warning"
data-test="js"
>
Adicionar
</button>

</div>


<div class="test-file">

<div>
<strong>Teste Stealer</strong>
<div class="meta">
Simula indicadores de coleta de dados
</div>
</div>

<button
class="btn warning"
data-test="stealer"
>
Adicionar
</button>

</div>


<div class="test-file">

<div>
<strong>Teste PowerShell</strong>
<div class="meta">
Simula comandos PowerShell suspeitos
</div>
</div>

<button
class="btn danger"
data-test="powershell"
>
Adicionar
</button>

</div>


<div class="test-file">

<div>
<strong>Teste crítico</strong>
<div class="meta">
